  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stone of mass <em>M</em> is attached to a string and moves in a horizontal circle or radius <em>R</em>. It takes the stone 2 seconds to complete one revolution.</p>\n<p>What is the work done by the centripetal force during 1 second of the stone’s motion?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi^{2}\"></span><em>R</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span><em>M</em></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi^{3}\"></span><em>R</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span><em>M</em></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi^{3}\"></span><em>R</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span><em>M</em></li>\n</ol>"
  },
